              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.preamble}}\n\nInputs:\n\n1. USER_INSTRUCTIONS - Optional\n\n   <USER_INSTRUCTIONS>\n      {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userInstructions}}\n   </USER_INSTRUCTIONS>\n   \n   * If this section is empty (or only the wrapper), ignore all overrides.\n\n2. Source XML paths(Input):\n\nThe following XML element paths are present in the source XML document:\n\n   {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.flattenedSourceXmlPaths}}\n\n3. **Reference XSLT** (use this mapping if you find mapping from below)  - Optional\n\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.whitespacesTrimmedXslt}}\n\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.defaultXsltRootStructure}}\n   \n4. **AVAILABLE TARGET FIELDS**\n  \n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.targetAttributes}}\n\n5. AUTO-DETECT STRUCTURE\n\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.structureDetection}} \n\nNo extra code, loops, or default field names should appear—the placeholders handle iteration internally.\n\nQA CHECKLIST (Internal)\n\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.qaChecklist}}"
            }
          ],
